      "output": "METRIC,VALUE,STATUS\nGROSS_WPM,90,VERIFIED\nACCURACY_PCT,98.5,OPTIMAL\nHOME_ROW,ASDF_JKL,TOUCH_TYPING_BENCHMARK_VERIFIED\nHOME_ROW,ASDF_JKL,TOUCH_TYPING_BENCHMARK_VERIFIED",
